        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6za",
          "text": ", Colorado has legalized lane filtering under specific conditions, but full lane splitting remains prohibited. Acknowledging these laws helps motorcyclists avoid fines, makes safer road interactions, and educates other drivers about sharing the road responsibly with motorcycles in Colorado. At ",
