          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6zo",
          "text": ", but lane filtering, under specific conditions, is now allowed for motorcyclists. This change reflects evolving state policy to improve rider safety in slow-moving urban traffic. ",
          "marks": []
