          "_key": "s71s",
          "text": "Stop filtering when traffic starts moving.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b71x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s71u",
          "text": "Only filter where ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s71v",
          "text": "adequate space",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s71w",
          "text": " allows.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b721",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s71y",
          "text": "Ride with ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s71z",
          "text": "due care",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s720",
          "text": " and not exceed 15 mph.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b725",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s722",
          "text": "According to the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s723",
          "text": "Colorado State Patrol",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s724",
          "text": ", enforcement will target unsafe or unauthorized maneuvers, particularly when riders exceed the speed limit or attempt to filter in moving traffic.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b727",
      "style": "h4",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s726",
          "text": "Conditions under which lane filtering is permitted:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b729",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s728",
          "text": "The road must have two or more lanes in the same direction.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72b",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72a",
          "text": "Lane filtering is only allowed when traffic is completely stopped.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72d",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72c",
          "text": "Motorcycles must not travel faster than 15 mph while filtering.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72e",
          "text": "Motorcyclists must yield to pedestrians and other road users.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72h",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72g",
          "text": "It is prohibited to filter on highways or roads exceeding 45 mph.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72j",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72i",
          "text": "Knowing these guidelines guarantees that motorcyclists can safely and legally take advantage of lane filtering.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72l",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72k",
          "text": "When did these laws take effect?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72m",
          "text": "The lane filtering law became effective in Colorado in 2024 following approval from the state legislature. The law outlines specific circumstances under which riders may filter through traffic, focusing on ensuring safety while granting motorcyclists more flexibility in urban congestion.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72p",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72o",
          "text": "What is the Purpose of the Lane Filtering Law?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72r",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72q",
          "text": "The legislation seeks to simplify traffic flow and handle main safety issues. Especially in crowded cities, letting motorbikes negotiate between stopped cars greatly lowers the likelihood of getting struck from behind.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72t",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72s",
          "text": "The New Law Could Save Lives",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72v",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72u",
          "text": "Rear-end collisions are a frequent cause of motorcycle fatalities. When motorcyclists can position themselves ahead of stopped traffic, they are less vulnerable to inattentive drivers who may fail to notice them at intersections or in slow-moving conditions. In states where similar laws have been enacted, studies indicate a decrease in motorcycle-related accidents.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b72x",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72w",
          "text": "Other potential benefits of lane filtering include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b730",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72y",
          "text": "Reduced road congestion:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s72z",
          "text": " Motorcycles moving through stopped traffic help clear space, leading to a smoother traffic flow.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b733",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s731",
          "text": "Decreased exposure to exhaust fumes:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s732",
          "text": " By moving ahead of vehicles, riders avoid prolonged exposure to harmful emissions.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b738",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s734",
          "text": "Lower crash risks for motorcyclists:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s735",
          "text": " Studies from other states show that controlled lane filtering can ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s736",
          "text": "reduce crash rates",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s737",
          "text": " when properly executed.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73a",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s739",
          "text": "With Rights Comes Responsibility",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73f",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l73c",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://legalclarity.org/colorado-left-lane-rules-usage-penalties-and-exceptions/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73b",
          "text": "While the new law provides motorcyclists with additional riding privileges, it also demands responsible behavior on the road. Riders must exercise caution and adhere to the ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73d",
          "text": "stipulations outlined",
          "marks": [
            "l73c"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73e",
          "text": " in the legislation.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73h",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73g",
          "text": "Where do Motorcycle riders stop in a long queue?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73j",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73i",
          "text": "When traffic is backed up, motorcyclists may stop at the front of the queue at an intersection if they are lawfully filtering through lanes. Positioning at the front also prevents motorcycles from being trapped between larger vehicles, reducing the risk of collisions in stop-and-go traffic situations. However, they must yield to pedestrians and ensure their movements do not pose a risk to other drivers.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73k",
          "text": "In many cases, motorcycles that successfully filter to the front will position themselves between the frontmost stopped vehicles, ensuring that they are visible to all drivers when the light turns green. This positioning allows them to start moving safely before larger vehicles begin accelerating, reducing the risk of being rear-ended.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73n",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73m",
          "text": "Additional considerations include:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73q",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73o",
          "text": "Ensuring visibility to surrounding traffic:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73p",
          "text": " Riders should avoid stopping in blind spots where they might not be seen by larger vehicles.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73t",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73r",
          "text": "Staying within designated lane spaces:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73s",
          "text": " Motorcyclists should not extend beyond lanes or encroach upon crosswalks.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73w",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73u",
          "text": "Being prepared for a quick start:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73v",
          "text": " When filtering to the front, motorcyclists should be attentive to traffic signals to avoid delaying other vehicles behind them.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b73z",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73x",
          "text": "Avoiding unnecessary filtering:",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s73y",
          "text": " If traffic is flowing at an acceptable speed, filtering may not always be necessary.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b741",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s740",
          "text": "Why can’t you pass on the right?",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b743",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s742",
          "text": "Motorcyclists should not pass on the right unless a designated lane exists for such movement. This prevents accidents caused by sudden lane changes or vehicles unexpectedly turning right.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b745",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s744",
          "text": "Understanding Lane Filtering",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b747",
      "style": "h3",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s746",
          "text": "Motorcyclists: Filter Safely",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
