      "_key": "b749",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s748",
          "text": "Lane filtering is only permitted when vehicles are completely stopped, and motorcyclists must proceed with caution, ensuring they do not exceed a reasonable speed differential with other traffic. Safety tips for motorcyclists include:",
