      "_key": "b74l",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s74k",
          "text": "Car and truck drivers should remain aware of motorcycles filtering through traffic. Checking mirrors and blind spots before changing lanes is crucial to avoiding collisions. Additionally, blocking a motorcyclist from filtering could be considered reckless driving.",
